## 3. Recommended Tech Stack

| Layer | Choice | Why |
|---|---|---|
| Frontend | React (Next.js) + Tailwind CSS | SSR/SEO for product pages, fast to match the maroon/cream design tokens |
| State | Zustand or Redux Toolkit | Cart/Wishlist state shared across drawer + pages |
| Backend | Node.js + Express (or Next.js API routes) | Single JS stack |
| Database | PostgreSQL (relational: orders, inventory) | Transactional integrity for cart/orders |
| Auth | Firebase Phone Auth or MSG91/Twilio OTP | Matches phone+OTP login screen |
| Payments | Razorpay | ₹ (INR) pricing shown throughout |
| Media | Cloudinary / S3 | Product images, banners |
| Search | Algolia or Postgres full-text (v2) | Category/product search icon in header |
| Maps | Google Maps Embed API | Contact Us map |
| Hosting | Vercel (frontend) + Render/Railway (API) | Simple CI/CD |

