## 7. API Endpoint Map

| Module | Method & Path | Purpose |
|---|---|---|
| Auth | `POST /auth/otp/request` | send OTP to phone |
| Auth | `POST /auth/otp/verify` | verify OTP, issue session |
| Products | `GET /products?section=new-arrivals` | **dynamic**, sorted by `created_at DESC` or `is_new_arrival` flag |
| Products | `GET /products?section=featured` | curated via `is_featured` flag (admin-controlled) |
| Products | `GET /products?category=&occasion=&sort=&page=&limit=&minPrice=&maxPrice=` | **dynamic** Product Listing page — server-side filter/sort/paginate |
| Products | `GET /products/:slug` | **dynamic** PDP detail (live price/stock/discount/images) |
| Products | `GET /products/:id/related` | related products for PDP (same category, excluding self) |
| Products | `GET /products/:id/reviews` | reviews for PDP |
| Cart | `GET /cart` | fetch current cart |
| Cart | `POST /cart/items` | add item |
| Cart | `PATCH /cart/items/:id` | update qty |
| Cart | `DELETE /cart/items/:id` | remove item |
| Cart | `POST /cart/apply-coupon` | validate + apply promo code |
| Wishlist | `GET /wishlist` | fetch saved items |
| Wishlist | `POST /wishlist` | add item |
| Wishlist | `DELETE /wishlist/:id` | remove / or move-to-cart (combined transaction) |
| Orders | `POST /orders` | create order from cart |
| Orders | `GET /orders/:id` | order confirmation/status |
| Reviews | `GET /products/:id/reviews` | list reviews |
| Newsletter | `POST /newsletter/subscribe` | footer email capture |
| Contact | `POST /contact` | contact form submit (if added) |

