## 8. Expected Output / Deliverables

1. Responsive storefront (mobile-first, matches maroon `#8B1E2E`-ish + cream `#FBEEDD`-ish palette, serif display font for headings + sans body).
2. Fully working Cart & Wishlist with persistent state (DB-backed once logged in, localStorage before login).
3. OTP-based auth gating checkout only (browsing/wishlist can be guest-friendly, checkout requires login — confirm this rule with stakeholder).
4. Admin-manageable product catalog (even a simple CMS/JSON-driven seed for v1).
5. Working Razorpay checkout with order summary math (MRP − discount + shipping = total) matching the screens exactly.
6. About/Contact static pages with live Google Map embed.
7. SEO-friendly URLs (`/category/wedding`, `/products/pista-green-threadwork-chiffon-saree`).

